  "text": "The largest bone in the human body is the femur, also known as the thigh bone.\n\nHere is the prose translated into verse:\n\nA cavern vast, of knowledge deep,\nWhere human curiosity sleeps\nIn silent halls, in endless rows,\nWhere every spine a story knows.\n\nEach book a door, a world untold,\nA life beyond the present mold,\nWatched o’er by one with wisdom’s grace,\nWho knows each tale, each hidden face."
